  "releaseProvenance": "Fresh 11 October captures from the native Synth 0.1.4 image on the author's octatrick 2.12 (MAIN OS 00fa6caa..., Modwerk's export-composition-proofs.py, author source ca13ed8, tag v2.12). Seven screenshots are byte-identical to the capture of the same plan on the 0.1.4 build of the 2.11 line (MAIN OS 248d987e..., author source 5f3d745). ot-voices.png differs by design: choosing FM SYNTH now writes its init, VOIC 1 into LFO 3's SPD3 byte, so the VOIC dial is drawn at its first position (the 2.11 build left the stock byte, which also reads VOIC 1). The plan is 0.1.2's with waits, plus LFO SETUP and SELECT MACHINE TYPE; ot-root.png was captured but is not committed (eight media per module). No hardware verification is conferred.",
